{"reviews":[{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-0","r":3.0,"t":"... here within a few days which made me really happy however when applied its not very pigmented and you ...","x":"Got here within a few days which made me really happy however when applied its not very pigmented and you have to apply a lot. Also was broken when arrived","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-1","r":2.0,"t":"Does not look anything like the picture","x":"Does not look anything like the picture.  They are 4 different shades, yes, but they are so light they almost look like a variation of white to very light pink. The tan color does not look tan, more like yellow.  Went on easily but faded away very quickly. Overall not a great product.  Would not order again.  Will be returning.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-2","r":2.0,"t":"Two Stars","x":"This arrived broken. 2 of the powders are completely smashed.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-3","r":3.0,"t":"Good but damaged","x":"Shipping wasn't long at all but my product was all crushed up","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-4","r":1.0,"t":"Highly disappointed that it arrived LATE & BROKEN!!!","x":"I purchased this as a Christmas gift for my daughter and not only did it arrive the day AFTER Christmas but it was also broken.  I should have read more reviews & not wasted my money.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-5","r":1.0,"t":"Came damaged","x":"This product came in today and it was damaged, it did deliver very fast but I can't use it.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-6","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love it it's not too bold and still highlights nicely this is great for an every day look","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-7","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"very pretty. I use it on my eyes and it gives a natural glow.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-8","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"NO ISSUES WITH THE PRODUCT AND ARRIVED AS PROMISED","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-9","r":2.0,"t":"Arrived broken.","x":"The product arrived broken. It was shipped in just a plastic bag with no protection. I ordered this item as a gift so I was petty disappointed. The actual product itself seems good for the money. The colors were light and pretty for a teenage girl.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-10","r":2.0,"t":"Idk about this.","x":"I received this today and I was so excited to get it. But when I opened it up there was powder all over and one of the colors was completely missing. I'm disappointed and would like a new one sent to me.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-11","r":5.0,"t":"Multiple uses beautiful shimmer","x":"Great product that can be used not only as highlighter but as shadow as well. The colors are very complimenting and if you layer you can get a bright bold shimmer like a shadow.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-12","r":3.0,"t":"I really like the colors of the contour","x":"I really like the colors of the contour, but one of the colors did come broken. I was able to repair it by mixing it with rubbing alcohol then pressing it back into the case.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-13","r":2.0,"t":"When arrived, one of the disks was shattered and ...","x":"When arrived, one of the disks was shattered and completely a mess. yet, everything else in my package(including other pallets and highlighters) wasnt broken?","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-14","r":2.0,"t":"When arrived, one of the disks was shattered and ...","x":"When arrived, one of the disks was shattered and completely a mess. yet, everything else in my package(including other pallets and highlighters) wasnt broken?","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-15","r":1.0,"t":"Such a waste of money","x":"There's no glitter. No highlight about it. Such a waste of money. I'm returning this product! It also made my face break out. Yuck!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-16","r":4.0,"t":"Great Product","x":"Very shiny. Really good quality. Bronze highlight came shattered but it was easily fixed with rubbing alcohol.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-17","r":1.0,"t":"I am so sad because I was really looking forward to this product ...","x":"This came broken. I am so sad because I was really looking forward to this product and now I\u2019m disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-18","r":5.0,"t":"Dark skin.","x":"Great colors for dark skin. Makes you look super glowy. Beautiful for the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-19","r":3.0,"t":"very nice but it's a light highlighter","x":"Not as strong as the pictures.. very nice but it's a light highlighter","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-20","r":2.0,"t":"Would not repurchase","x":"This product has no visible sparkle or even a slight shimmer. The top left color is almost identical to bottom right, and the top left &#34;lightest&#34; color is hardly any lighter. The gold color is an OK subtle bronzer and the only color I've significantly used, but the powder has to be almost scrubbed onto a brush and it's extremely unpigmented so requires a lot of product. Also the packaging is crap and extremely messy.  Would not repurchase and hope I can make use of it when doing makeup o","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-21","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE IT","x":"My grand daughter used this on many different areas of her body for high lighting purposes. She really liked it. Said it went on easily and stayed on. She is very fair skinned so it looked really nice and stood out. You get 4 colors and they are a matte with a sparklyness to it. It is a compact design and worked great for contouring also. She had no irritations or problems with it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-22","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT BUY","x":"This highlighter palette is awful. The bottom left shade was completely destroyed when it was arrived. The remaining 3 shades were super powdery and they enhanced every pore when I applied it. I don\u2019t even understand how they can call this a \u201ccontour highlighter\u201d palette when ALL the shades are shimmery. There is no way you could contour with this. I highly DO NOT recommend this!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-23","r":4.0,"t":"Good alternative to name-brands","x":"The highlighter is a little loose in the pan, but overall it gave me a nice glow. I use each shade from the #2 palette and they all have a slightly different sheen to them. Applying without foundation makes them look a little cakey, but I still get compliments on it.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XNN2ZD6-24","r":2.0,"t":"however this product looks nothing like the picture and has no pigment whatsoever","x":"I usually don't write reviews but I was really excited to receive this product. I got it in 2 days and I don't have prime, however this product looks nothing like the picture and has no pigment whatsoever. I applied several layers and still, nothing came of it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the product arriving broken or damaged, often with shattered or crushed powders.","cites":[1,3,4,5,6,10,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the colors are lighter than expected and don't match the pictures.","cites":[2,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product not very pigmented and quick to fade.","cites":[1,2]},{"text":"Positive reviewers praise the pretty, natural shimmer and its versatility as highlighter and eyeshadow.","cites":[7,8,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention fast shipping, though some experienced late delivery.","cites":[1,5,6,9]}]},"qa":[]}